This appendix expands the experimental section of the main paper. Appendix B.1 gives the full implementation and reproducibility details; Appendix B.2 gives per-task breakdowns of the streaming results;
Appendix B.3 reports the per-backbone, per-budget numbers;
Appendix B.4 ablates the four scalar hyperparameters $(\alpha,\eta,\lambda,\varepsilon_{0})$ ;
Appendix B.7 extends the design ablations of Section 4.7 to the full sweep;
Appendix B.5 provides per-task coverage CDFs;
Appendix B.6 extends the memory–throughput sweep;
Appendix B.8 covers the cross-layer cascade analysis.
